    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "GENESTEALER CULTS begin with Resurgence points by size: 6 for Incursion, 10 at Strike Force and 14 at Onslaught. When an eligible unit dies, you may pay the cost for its original size, omitting Attached CHARACTERS. Each non-CHARACTER model must have Cult Ambush. Costs at the two sizes are Aberrants 4/8, Acolyte Hybrids or Hybrid Metamorphs 2/4, Atalan Jackals 2/6, Neophyte Hybrids 3/6 and Purestrain Genestealers 2/6. The two Neophyte Hybrids sizes are 10 and 20. The others are 5 and 10. Add a fresh copy without CHARACTERS to Cult Ambush. Restore its full strength and wounds, with [ONE SHOT] weapons available again. Use a circular 32 mm Cult Ambush marker, placed over 9 inches horizontally from every enemy unit if possible. A non-AIRCRAFT enemy model ending any move within 8 inches of a marker removes it. Units in Cult Ambush count as being in Strategic Reserves, with special setup through the markers. They are ineligible for Rapid Ingress and avoid the normal round-three destruction deadline. When the opposing side’s next Movement phase ends, you may make one Ingress move per surviving marker, using a unit in Cult Ambush. Set up that unit so the marker touches a model’s base and the other models fit entirely within 3 inches of it. Remove the marker after setup. This form of arrival is available in round one.",
